#: prefs_guide_about.js:52
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "指南"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:68
msgid ""
"Multi-monitor productivity with configurable layouts for windows and a GNOME "
"Top Bar that seamlessly follows your focus."
msgstr ""
"多显示器生产力工具，具有可配置的窗口布局，以及无缝跟随您的焦点的 GNOME 顶栏。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:79
msgid "Window Layouts & The Zone Designer"
msgstr "窗口布局与区域设计器"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:81
msgid "Draw Your Workspace"
msgstr "绘制您的工作区"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:82
msgid ""
"Open the OmniPanel system tray menu and toggle \"Zone Designer Mode\". Click "
"and drag your mouse on any monitor to draw a rectangular zone, name it, and "
"hit Save."
msgstr ""
"打开 OmniPanel 系统托盘菜单并切换到“区域设计器模式”。在任何显示器上单击并拖动"
"鼠标以绘制矩形区域，命名并点击保存。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:86
msgid "Auto-Restore and Fuzzy Matching"
msgstr "自动恢复与模糊匹配"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:87
msgid ""
"Layouts are automatically saved based on your current monitor setup. Unplug "
"and replug your screens, and your customized layouts return instantly."
msgstr ""
"布局会根据您当前的显示器设置自动保存。拔下并重新插入屏幕，您的自定义布局会立"
"即恢复。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:92
msgid "Smart Placement & Exclusions"
msgstr "智能放置与排除"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:94
msgid "Auto-Routing and Affinity"
msgstr "自动路由与关联"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:95
msgid ""
"Name a zone \"Terminals\" and apps like Alacritty snap there automatically. "
"Drag a window into a different zone, and OmniPanel learns your preference "
"permanently."
msgstr ""
"将一个区域命名为“Terminals”，像 Alacritty 这样的应用会自动吸附到那里。将窗口"
"拖入其他区域，OmniPanel 会永久记住您的偏好。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:99
msgid "Quick Desktop Access"
msgstr "快速访问桌面"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:100
msgid ""
"Use the \"Show Desktop\" button in the top bar to instantly minimize and "
"restore windows on your current monitor."
msgstr "使用顶栏中的“显示桌面”按钮可立即最小化并恢复当前显示器上的窗口。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:104 prefs_tiling.js:127
msgid "Ignored Applications"
msgstr "已忽略的应用"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:105
msgid ""
"Define a comma-separated list of app names (like \"steam\" or \"gimp\") in "
"the layout settings to keep OmniPanel from ever managing them."
msgstr ""
"在布局设置中定义以逗号分隔的应用名称列表（如“steam”或“gimp”），以防 "
"OmniPanel 管理它们。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:109
msgid "Show the GNOME Top Bar on All Monitors"
msgstr "在所有显示器上显示 GNOME 顶栏"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:110
msgid ""
"OmniPanel teleports the active Top Bar to the monitor where your focus is. "
"See your current time, system tray, and app indicators no matter which "
"screen you are on."
msgstr ""
"OmniPanel 会将活动顶栏传送到您焦点所在的显示器。无论您在哪个屏幕上，都能看到"
"当前时间、系统托盘和应用指示器。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:114
msgid "Active and Inactive Appearance"
msgstr "活动和非活动外观"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:115
msgid ""
"Highlight the active Top Bar with a custom color, or make inactive panels "
"translucent and distraction-free."
msgstr ""
"使用自定义颜色突出显示活动的顶栏，或使非活动的面板半透明以免分散注意力。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:120
msgid "Hotkeys, Snapping & Stacks"
msgstr "热键、吸附与堆叠"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:123
msgid "Window Stacks"
msgstr "窗口堆叠"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:124
msgid ""
"When multiple windows share the exact same zone, a Stack Indicator appears. "
"Hover over it to quickly cycle apps or seamlessly expand them into Stack, "
"Column, Row, or Grid views."
msgstr ""
"当多个窗口共享完全相同的区域时，会出现堆叠指示器。将鼠标悬停在其上可快速循环"
"切换应用，或将它们无缝扩展为堆叠、列、行或网格视图。"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:128
msgid "Directional Snapping and Cycling"
msgstr "方向吸附与循环"

#: prefs_guide_about.js:129
msgid ""
"Press Alt + Arrows to intuitively snap the active window into a neighboring "
"Drop Zone. Bind a hotkey to instantly loop through your saved Layouts."
msgstr ""
"按 Alt + 方向键将活动窗口直观地吸附到相邻的放置区域。绑定热键可立即在您保存的"
"布局中循环切换。"

